cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "The Farm Share Evidence Program"
abstract: >-
  Open measurement infrastructure for U.S. farm price realisation —
  certification, intermediation, and credit. The programme reconstructs
  longitudinal panels from federal operational registers that are published over
  time, and preserves registers that are maintained only as current-state
  listings and are otherwise lost. Version 0.1.0 establishes the programme's
  charter, standards, verified source register, and register preservation
  pipeline; no research artifacts have been released.
